{
  "id": "price-panel",
  "title": "Price panel · catalogue and filters",
  "blurb": "Format prices on the server-rendered catalogue and browser-filtered view. One change reaches two entry points: the server renders products with formatted prices, and the browser re-applies filters on each product's price.",
